+# HSM / KMS Key Rotation Runbook
+
+Overview
+- Rotate signing keys in a controlled, audited manner across AWS/GCP/Azure KMS/HSM.
+
+Pre-reqs
+- Obtain new key IDs from each provider and store them in Vault under secret/data/aegis/kms/<provider>
+- Prepare list of artifacts to re-sign (delegation manifests, attestation bundles)
+
+Steps
+1. Prepare new keys and test signing in staging.
+2. Update Vault with new key refs (do not remove old keys).
+3. Run ops/hsm/rotate_and_rekey.sh with a list of artifacts to re-sign.
+4. Verify new signatures with multi_sign_verify.py
+5. After verification, retire old keys per org policy and update Vault.
+6. Record rotation event in audit ledger and notify insurer/auditor if required.
